Canceling a BoH is no problem. Well, it'll bump it from blessed, which
it probably is (should be, anyway) now, to uncursed, which means that
you'll suddenly be rather more encumbered, but that's easily solved with
a !oHW. It won't destroy it, change it into a sack, do things to the
contents, or anything like that.
The only things you have to worry about with BoH are one, not putting
another BoH, a BoTricks, or a non-empty /oCancel in it - those, and only
those, will (if contained in multiple sacks, possibly; if not,
certainly) blow it up, and destroy it and its contents; and two, not
looting a cursed BoH, since that will destroy a random number of items
in it. Anything else is safe.

